### Test API Health
GET http://localhost:5000/api/health

###
### Test Single Fraud Prediction
POST http://localhost:5000/api/predict
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transaction_id": "TXN-001",
  "amount": 150.00,
  "merchant_category": 1,
  "transaction_type": 0,
  "time_hour": 14,
  "days_since_last_transaction": 5,
  "transaction_count_24h": 3,
  "amount_variance": 1.2,
  "location_change": 0,
  "device_change": 0,
  "velocity_score": 50
}

###
### Test Suspicious Transaction (High Amount, Unusual Time)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/predict
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transaction_id": "TXN-002",
  "amount": 800.00,
  "merchant_category": 0,
  "transaction_type": 0,
  "time_hour": 3,
  "days_since_last_transaction": 1,
  "transaction_count_24h": 5,
  "amount_variance": 2.5,
  "location_change": 1,
  "device_change": 1,
  "velocity_score": 85
}

###
### Test Batch Prediction
POST http://localhost:5000/api/batch-predict
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transactions": [
    {
      "transaction_id": "TXN-003",
      "amount": 200.00,
      "merchant_category": 2,
      "transaction_type": 1,
      "time_hour": 10,
      "days_since_last_transaction": 3,
      "transaction_count_24h": 2,
      "amount_variance": 1.1,
      "location_change": 0,
      "device_change": 0,
      "velocity_score": 40
    },
    {
      "transaction_id": "TXN-004",
      "amount": 600.00,
      "merchant_category": 5,
      "transaction_type": 2,
      "time_hour": 2,
      "days_since_last_transaction": 7,
      "transaction_count_24h": 10,
      "amount_variance": 3.0,
      "location_change": 1,
      "device_change": 1,
      "velocity_score": 90
    }
  ]
}

